sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    actor A as Admin
    participant CRC as ClientReservationController
    participant PVC as PaymentVerificationController
    participant RS as ReservationService
    participant DB as DB

    C->>CRC: POST /reservation/{token}/payments
    CRC->>DB: insert payment_verification (en_attente)
    DB-->>CRC: paiement cree

    A->>PVC: PATCH statut paiement (valide/refuse)
    PVC->>DB: update payment_verifications.statut
    DB-->>PVC: OK
    PVC->>RS: recalculerMontantsReservation()
    RS->>DB: update paid_amount + statut reservation
    DB-->>PVC: OK
